siriushq/netbsd_src
===================

NetBSD is a free, fast, secure, and highly portable Unix-like
open-source operating system.  This repository hosts a mirror of the
source-code, available in the `trunk` branch, retrieved from the
official Git mirror of the CVS repository.  There are several guides 
for kernel developers and users, the formatted guide is available at:

	https://www.netbsd.org/docs/guide/en/

This repository is maintained to provide a Git workflow for forks and
other projects that depend on the NetBSD source tree.  The `trunk`
branch is the exclusive tracking-branch for every dependent.
